      "verdict": "Archive Judgement: HUNCE wins",
      "summary": "DOMI had strong moments, especially in round one. His fake-designer sequence, student-finance/trapping angle, PASSIVE callback and “six-foot Somali cockroach” line gave him some of the clearest punches of the battle. His second also had decent status attacks, especially the PenGame reject and PS4/Wii material.\n\nHowever, HUNCE was more consistent across the full battle. He had more complete rounds, stronger momentum, and a much cleaner finish. DOMI’s final-round stumble, where he loses his words and says the prop threw him off, damages his case heavily.\n\nArchive score: HUNCE 2-1.\n\nArchive note: DOMI had sharper individual moments, but HUNCE completed the battle better and finished stronger."
