    "clashSummary": "JAYCEE vs FENDRY took place on a PenGame Rap Battles card sponsored by **Forward Studios** and **Platinum Education Services**, with the host also promoting PenGame Academy TikTok Live auditions and the March 16th livestream event.\n\nFENDRY wins the coin toss and lets JAYCEE go first. JAYCEE opens with a long, aggressive round aimed at positioning himself above FENDRY. He attacks FENDRY as an amateur, a fan, someone not suited to the roster, someone who needed help from JM, and someone who should not be sharing a stage with him.\n\nFENDRY responds with a more compact but sharper round, attacking JAYCEE’s singing background, X Factor history, mask/image, voice, age/image contradiction, romantic reputation, alleged virginity, and suitability for battle rap. There is **no official judge decision** in the transcript. The host closes by telling viewers to comment who they think won.",
