        "performer": "WHOISORION",
        "overview": "WHOISORION showed why the judges felt he had been one step ahead across Group C. His rounds had more battle theatre. He knew when to joke, when to go personal, when to bring people into the moment and when to close with a bigger angle.\n\nHis final round was the separator. Instead of only attacking DAN directly, he widened the battle into a story about DAN and F-DON, jealousy, shadows and friendship tension. Whether every claim is true or not, it sounded researched and dramatic, which made it land in the room. That preparation won him the decision.",
