    "clashSummary": "SEVZ vs CHEEZEE opened the PenGame Season 4 quarter-finals on the Road to Wembley. The judges were Madey Fink, M1 On The Beat and Steve-O The Madman, and the tone was set early: clean slate, no cap rapping, no fighting, and the winner moving through to the semi-finals. CHEEZEE went first after SEVZ won the coin toss and sent him in.\n\nCHEEZEE came with high energy, a strong crowd presence and a clear angle around SEVZ being young, inexperienced and still needing guidance. SEVZ answered with sharper punchlines, more tailored material and heavier name flips around cheese, food, age, family and CHEEZEE’s earlier battles.\n\nThe judges gave it to SEVZ. Madey Fink had SEVZ winning all three, while Steve-O and M1 both scored it 2-1 SEVZ. CHEEZEE was praised for energy, but SEVZ was judged as more prepared, more direct and more punch-heavy. SEVZ advanced to the semi-finals.",
